    "source": "7,700 kcal per kg of fat (standard); energy density fat 9, carbohydrate and protein 4, alcohol 7 kcal/g; glycogen about 400 g in muscle and liver, lasts about a day of hard work; in starvation, death near 50 to 60% of starting body mass or when fat is exhausted and protein is the only fuel (NUT-STARVE). Lean mass follows MUSCULAR development.",
